	],
	"notice": "Match the hardware MIDI channel and receive settings. Six-voice model with TRS MIDI IN and OUT and note velocity support. Use the correct MIDI adapter. Chorus depth CC93 and reverb depth CC91 are documented additional MIDI parameters; the physical Chorus button is not assigned a guessed CC toggle here.  GUI controls generate MIDI into the chain; route that chain to a MIDI output to control the hardware. DIN devices normally appear under the MIDI interface name, so select the profile manually. Unmapped physical buttons and switches have stable SVG IDs for future bindings. Positions are schematic. Note surfaces use virtual defaults; use MIDI learn to match the hardware octave or configuration.",
